sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Eligible participant
    participant UI as Review / report UI (frontend not built)
    participant API as Conduct API
    participant S as Conduct service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (migrations not merged)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over U,DB: Sequence 1 - Review. Confirmed rules, implemented on branches, not merged
    Note over UI,DB: Completed and not Cancelled. Reviewer and reviewee are the Host or a member with left_at NULL or left_at >= ends_at. No self review
    U->>UI: Select another participant, enter rating and comment
    UI->>UI: Validate form, disable submit
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/parties/{id}/reviews + session/CSRF
    alt Session / CSRF / input invalid
        API-->>UI: 401 / 403 / 400 (rating integer 1-5, comment required, max 500), re-enable form
    else Valid input
        API->>S: Validated reviewee/rating/comment, reviewer from session
        S->>DB: BEGIN, lock Party row (SELECT FOR UPDATE)
        DB-->>S: Party
        S->>S: Read clock after the lock, then check state, participants and reviewee != reviewer
        alt Party not found / not completed / reviewer not eligible / self or ineligible reviewee
            S->>DB: ROLLBACK
            S-->>API: NOT_FOUND / PARTY_NOT_COMPLETED / FORBIDDEN / INVALID_INPUT
            API-->>UI: 404 / 409 / 403 / 400, no review stored
        else Eligible
            S->>DB: SAVEPOINT, insert PartyReview
            alt unique_party_review conflict
                DB-->>S: Savepoint rolled back
                Note over S,DB: Conflict is caught outside the failed savepoint, a pre-check alone is insufficient
                S->>DB: ROLLBACK
                S-->>API: REVIEW_EXISTS
                API-->>UI: 409, no duplicate and no second count
            else Inserted
                S->>DB: Update reviewee rating_sum and rating_count with F()
                alt Reviewee has no profile
                    S->>DB: ROLLBACK, review is removed with the transaction
                    S-->>API: INVALID_INPUT on reviewee_id
                    API-->>UI: 400, no review stored
                else Rating cache updated
                    S->>DB: COMMIT
                    S-->>API: Review saved
                    API-->>UI: 201 with party_id and reviewer.id for the submitter
                    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/{id}/reviews with page and page_size
                    API->>DB: Read profile cache and one page, newest first
                    DB-->>API: rating_sum, rating_count, reviews, total
                    API-->>UI: average_rating (null when count is 0), reviewer display_name, rating, comment, created_at
                    Note over API,UI: Read API never sends email, student id, reviewer id or party id
                    UI-->>U: Saved review and current summary
                end
            end
        end
    end
    end

    autonumber 1 1
    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
    Note over U,DB: Sequence 2 - No-show report. Behind NO_SHOW_ENABLED=false, not confirmed for Sprint 2
    Note over UI,DB: Window, threshold, deduction and credit base are proposals pending issues 100 and 105, see docs/us14-d-01-decisions.md
    U->>UI: Select participant to report
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/parties/{id}/no-show-reports + session/CSRF
    alt Flag off
        Note over UI,API: CSRF middleware still runs first, a tokenless POST gets 403 CSRF_FAILED
        API-->>UI: 404 NOT_FOUND before login check, parsing or any query
    else Flag on
        alt Session / CSRF / input invalid
            API-->>UI: 401 / 403 / 400
        else Valid input
            API->>S: Validated reported_id, reporter from session
            S->>DB: BEGIN, lock Party row (SELECT FOR UPDATE)
            DB-->>S: Party
            S->>S: Read clock after the lock, check state, report window (proposal 7 days), participants, not self
            alt Party not found / not completed / window closed / reporter not eligible / invalid reported user
                S->>DB: ROLLBACK
                S-->>API: NOT_FOUND / PARTY_NOT_COMPLETED / REPORT_WINDOW_CLOSED / FORBIDDEN / INVALID_INPUT
                API-->>UI: 404 / 409 / 403 / 400, no report stored
            else Eligible
                S->>DB: SAVEPOINT, insert NoShowReport
                alt unique_no_show_report conflict
                    DB-->>S: Savepoint rolled back
                    Note over S,DB: Conflict is handled outside the failed savepoint
                    S->>DB: ROLLBACK
                    S-->>API: REPORT_EXISTS
                    API-->>UI: 409, nothing counted twice
                else Report inserted
                    S->>DB: Count reporters for this party and reported user
                    DB-->>S: Reporter count
                    S->>S: Threshold (proposal), N excludes the reported user, N == 1 needs 1, else max(2, N // 2 + 1)
                    opt Threshold reached and no deduction exists yet
                        S->>DB: Lock the UserProfile row of the reported user (SELECT FOR UPDATE)
                        S->>DB: SAVEPOINT, insert one ConductCreditEvent NoShowDeduction, delta -5 (proposal)
                        alt unique_conduct_credit_event conflict
                            DB-->>S: Savepoint rolled back, already deducted, balance unchanged
                        else Ledger event created
                            S->>DB: credit_score = current value + delta, base 100 when NULL (proposal, conflicts with D-6 and rule 13)
                        end
                    end
                    S->>DB: COMMIT
                    S-->>API: Report only
                    API-->>UI: 201 id, party_id, reported_id, created_at, never says whether credit changed
                end
            end
        end
    end
    end
